🧩 System Modules Overview

🔍 1. Code Fetcher & Filter

GitLab integration via python-gitlab or git clone

Walks through codebase to filter .py, .js, .ts, etc.

Applies keyword filters on function names, comments, docstrings


🧠 2. LLM Analyzer

Sends filtered function blocks to LLM

Uses prompt templates like:


Explain what this function does, including inputs, outputs, and any side-effects.

Supports OpenAI, Ollama, or HuggingFace LLMs


🛠️ 3. Documentation Builder

Converts function metadata and LLM output to structured Markdown or HTML

Can support exporting to:

GitLab Wiki

Markdown file in repo

External API




